	doi = {10.1145/3673971.3673991},
	url = {https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85204578206?origin=resultslist},
	abstract = {Thyroid nodules are common and multiple diseases of the head and neck. Ultrasound examination is an important imaging method for the diagnosis of benign and malignant thyroid nodules. The extraction of TI -RADS standard-related entity information from ultrasonic reports has an important influence on the intelligent judgment of benign and malignant of thyroid nodule. Based on TI-RADS system model, and using CRFs model and support vector machine technology, this study carried out post-structured analysis of Chinese ultrasonic thyroid report and obtained high accuracy. High quality information extraction provides important information support for the follow-up intelligent decision support, and provides a research basis for the automatic pre-diagnosis of benign and malignant thyroid nodules. © 2024 ACM.},
